Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Flexgen 58 must set with HSE_KER for low power management

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git 7601f030edfc3490d2f4a1ba9b7573016b1aff2d fix(fdts): set flexgen 58 to HSE_KER for STM32MP257F-DK]
