Signed-off-by: Maxime Méré <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/tf-a/+/408814
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Domain-Review: Patrick DELAUNAY <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
---
 fdts/stm32mp257f-dk-ca35tdcid-rcc.dtsi | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/fdts/stm32mp257f-dk-ca35tdcid-rcc.dtsi b/fdts/stm32mp257f-dk-ca35tdcid-rcc.dtsi
index e3ebc8275e..837abb43f3 100644
